# 🧠 LEADER: Large Language Model Enhanced Medication Recommendation

---

<details open>
<summary><b>📌 Overview</b></summary>

<br>

**LEADER** is a framework for EHR-based medication recommendation that improves:

- ✅ Prediction Accuracy  
- ✅ Interpretability  

### 🚨 Challenges
- Lack of molecular drug knowledge  
- Poor hierarchical modeling  

### 💡 Solution
- Hierarchical ATC prediction (L1 → L4)  
- Cross-attention drug fusion  
- Imbalance-aware training  

</details>

---

<details open>
<summary><b>🏗️ Framework</b></summary>

<br>

![Framework](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/framework-placeholder.png)

</details>

---

<details open>
<summary><b>🧩 Key Components</b></summary>

<br>

### 1️⃣ Hierarchical Prediction Head
- Multi-level ATC prediction  
- Consistency constraints  

### 2️⃣ Cross-Attention Drug Knowledge
- Molecular embedding fusion  
- Better drug representation  

### 3️⃣ 4-Layer Defense Strategy
- Focal Loss  
- Class Weights  
- Threshold Optimization  
- Hierarchical Loss  

</details>

